{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國加州理工學院研究團隊宣佈取得一項具有裏程碑意義的航天突破。一台由機械人自主控制的太空組裝系統成功在軌道上完成結構搭建任務，成為人類歷史上首次無需太空人參與便在太空中自主建造結構的案例。這項成果被認為有望徹底改變未來大型航天器、太空望遠鏡、通信設施以及空間太陽能發電系統的建造方式。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585978.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:40:29.464638+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:26:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:33:45.776820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:33:45.776820+00:00","content_hash":"18668f1a7d6fe8aea1dd0d0d620e453c3dd49b540a88b7b77cb341fe310783d7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}